@startuml
!theme cyborg
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam defaultFontColor #F3F4F6
allowmixing
title MIXED CORE / FUTURE — Proposed / illustrative — Git and collaboration capability boundaries
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

component "Native client / browser entry" as C
component "LC-07 Git Collaboration\nrepository / review / ref policy" as G
component "Evaluated native Git server adapter" as N
database "Native objects / refs" as D
database "Owned review / attempt metadata" as M
component "Workflow Coordination\nseparate trigger and execution gates" as W
component "Deployment\nseparate target approval" as T
component "Communication / notifications\nonly actual eligible contract" as O
C --> G : actual selected transport / public contract
G --> N
N --> D : Git-native handling
G --> M
G --> W : attributable revision observation
W --> T : no automatic approval
G ..> O : optional explicit supported reaction
note bottom of G
 Webhooks/event transport and independent services are not selected.
 No execution of repository-supplied hooks on trusted host.
end note

@enduml
